CITYCLERK'SOFFICE
2101O'Neil Ave., Room101
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
(307) 637-6346
MEMORANDUM
TO:
Mayor Richard L. Kaysen
Members of City Council
FROM:
Kristy Anderson, Deputy City Clerk K
DATE:
February 12,2016
RE:
City Liquor License Renewals for2016-2017
licenses (i.e.: retail, restaurant, limited retail, resort, bar & grill licenses and micro brewery permits)
and Liquor Licensee Actions that occurred during this past licensing year.Public hearings for the
applications are scheduled during the February 22,2016City Council meeting.
Due to the largevolume of paperwork involvedin renewing the liquor licenses, I didn’t
photocopy each application for your review.Instead, the attached listing provides the“basics”from
application information in a readable format.If you would like toreview an individual application
file, please contact me and I will make it available to you.Carol Intlekofer, City Clerk, and I will
be attending the City Council sessions and committee meeting to provide staff reports.
If you have any questions concerning applicant information or renewal requirements and
procedures, please do not hesitate to contact me at your convenience at Ext. 6346.
pc:
File
